      "content": "honestly, i'm just so tired of fighting. every time i think i found a solution, something else breaks. it feels like the universe is just telling me i'm not supposed to be here. like, if everything is already lost, what's the point of even trying to fix it? it just feels like the constant stress is actually worse than the thought of just... not having to deal with any of it anymore. it would be so much quieter if it just stopped.",
